    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Bradycardia is defined as a heart rate below 60 beats per minute. The ACLS focus is on symptomatic bradycardia - when the rate is inadequate for the pt's physiological needs & -> adverse signs or Sx directly attributable to the slow rate. Not all bradycardia requires tx."
     }
    ]
